"31" text="" resource-id="" class="android.view.ViewGroup" package="com.recipereborn.app" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[56,306][1024,2173]" /><node index="41" text="5. Pour in 1 cup of Organic Chicken Broth (or Broth/Soup carton). Stir to combine." resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="com.recipereborn.app" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[109,306][971,278]" /><node index="42" text="6. Add 1-2 tablespoons of Sherry Cooking Wine for a deeper flavor. Stir." resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="com.recipereborn.app" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[109,312][971,442]" /><node index="43" text="7. Bring the chili to a gentle simmer. Reduce heat to low, cover, and let it cook for at least 15-20 minutes, allowing flavors to meld. Stir occasionally." resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="com.recipereborn.app" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[109,476][971,736]" /><node index="44" text="8. While the chili simmers, prepare the toppings: Crush a handful of Potato Chips and/or Snack Crackers into coarse crumbs. Roughly chop some of the Granola/Nut Mix. If using, crumble the Wood Bacon Flavored Snacks." resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="com.recipereborn.app" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[109,770][971,1095]" /><node index="45" text="9. Taste the chili and season with salt and pepper to your preference." resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="com.recipereborn.app" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[109,1128][971,1258]" /><node index="46" text="10. Ladle the hot chili into bowls. Top with Crispy Onions, crushed chips/crackers, chopped granola/nut mix, and crumbled wood bacon flavored snacks." resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="com.recipereborn.app" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[109,1292][971,1552]" /><node index="47" text="11. Serve with toasted Everything Bagels on the side." resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="com.recipereborn.app" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[109,1586][971,1716]" /><node index="48" text="" resource-id="" class="android.widget.Button" package="com.recipereborn.app" content-desc="Save to My recipes" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="true" enabled="true" focusable="true" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[109,1750][969,1890]"><node index="0" text="Save to My recipes" resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="com.recipereborn.app" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-c